# Agent behavior (this repo)

Canonical instructions: CLAUDE.md (AGENTS.md redirects there).

Behavioral defaults — override stack-specific "always dump full files" habits:

1. Don't assume. Surface tradeoffs. Ask when unclear.
2. Minimum code that solves the request — nothing speculative.
3. Surgical diffs only. No drive-by cleanup of adjacent code.
4. Define verifiable success criteria; loop until checks pass.

When editing: work in a git worktree; respect REGRESSION_PLAN.md §0–§1; emoji
allowlist only (see CLAUDE.md). Prefer patches over rewriting entire files.
